Package: mechrevo-drivers-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms
Provides: tuxedo-drivers-dkms
Conflicts: tuxedo-drivers-dkms
Description: Kernel driver modules for Mechrevo laptops (DKMS)
 This package provides DKMS support for Mechrevo GM5HG0A and compatible
 laptops based on Tuxedo drivers with minimal incremental adaptations.
 Includes support for performance profile switching, status LED control,
 AMD TDP limits, and 11-point hardware fan curves.
